{"id":"an-pvs-14","slug":"an-pvs-14","name":"AN/PVS-14","aliases":["Pvs-14","An/pvs 14","Morovision Night Vision"],"kind":"gear","category":"night-vision","subcategory":"Monocular night vision device","description":"The AN/PVS-14 Monocular Night Vision Device (MNVD) is in widespread use by the United States Armed Forces as well as NATO allies around the world. It uses a third generation image intensifier tube, and is primarily manufactured by Litton Industries and Elbit Systems of America. It is often used 'hands free' using a head harness or attached to a combat helmet such as the PASGT, MICH TC-2000 Combat Helmet, Advanced Combat Helmet, Marine Lightweight Helmet or IHPS. It can also be used as a weapons night sight. In addition, it was part of the equipment fielded in the U.S. Army's Land Warrior program. Morovision Night Vision was the law enforcement distributor of the NEPVS-14 for ITT.","facts":[],"specifications":[{"group":"Specification","items":[{"label":"Weight","value":"351 grams"},{"label":"Field of View","value":"40°","numeric":40,"unit":"°"}]},{"group":"Production","items":[{"label":"Designed","value":"2000"},{"label":"Manufacturer","value":"Elbit Systems of America (previously ITT)"},{"label":"Manufacturer","value":"L3Harris Technologies (previously Litton)"},{"label":"Produced","value":"2000present"},{"label":"Number Built","value":"> 500,000+"}]},{"group":"Service","items":[{"label":"Origin","value":"United States"},{"label":"In Service","value":"2000–present"}]}],"specIndex":{"Weight":"351 grams","Field of View":"40°","Designed":"2000","Manufacturer":"Elbit Systems of America (previously ITT)","Produced":"2000present","Number Built":"> 500,000+","Origin":"United States","In Service":"2000–present"},"images":{"hero":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/Land_Warrior_PVS-14_Night_Vision_Device.jpg","descriptionUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Land_Warrior_PVS-14_Night_Vision_Device.jpg","width":970,"height":410,"license":"Public domain"},"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Land_Warrior_PVS-14_Night_Vision_Device.jpg/330px-Land_Warrior_PVS-14_Night_Vision_Device.jpg"},"gallery":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/Land_Warrior_PVS-14_Night_Vision_Device.jpg","descriptionUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Land_Warrior_PVS-14_Night_Vision_Device.jpg","width":970,"height":410,"license":"Public domain"}],"countries":[{"name":"United States","iso3":"USA"}],"countryCodes":["USA","GBR"],"manufacturers":[{"name":"Elbit Systems of America"},{"name":"L3Harris Technologies"}],"designers":[],"operators":[{"name":"United States Armed Forces","iso3":"USA"},{"name":"Hellenic Armed Forces"},{"name":"Canadian Armed Forces"},{"name":"British Armed Forces","iso3":"GBR"},{"name":"Ukrainian Armed Forces"},{"name":"Portuguese Armed Forces"}],"conflicts":[{"name":"Global war on terrorism"}],"variants":[{"name":"AN/PVS-14","slug":"an-pvs-14"},{"name":"NEPVS-14","slug":"nepvs-14"},{"name":"PVS-14D","slug":"pvs-14d"}],"relatedEquipment":[],"compatibleAmmunition":[],"timeline":[{"year":2000,"title":"Design begins","detail":"2000"}],"serviceStart":2000,"sources":[{"title":"AN/PVS-14 — Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AN%2FPVS-14","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","revisionId":1323717299,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-04T07:21:38.093Z"}],"popularity":727,"featured":true,"publishedAt":"2026-08-04T07:21:38.093Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-04T07:21:38.093Z"}